, "title": "1. 音声をモデル用の数値に変換 | VAEEncodeAudio", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VAEEncodeAudio"}}, {"id": 40, "type": "SolidMask", "pos": [72.8787878787878, 2827.424242424243], "size": [350, 135], "flags": {}, "order": 16, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "links": [11]}], "title": "2. 音声を書き換えない：0 | SolidMask", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SolidMask"}, "widgets_values": [0, 32, 32], "widgets_values_named": {"value": 0, "width": 32, "height": 32}}, {"id": 41, "type": "SetLatentNoiseMask", "pos": [498.3333333333335, 2835.0000000000005], "size": [359.1587890625, 115], "flags": {}, "order": 87, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "link": 10}, {"name": "mask", "type": "MASK", "link": 11}], "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "links": [12]}], "title": "3. 音声の変更を禁止する印 | SetLatentNoiseMask", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SetLatentNoiseMask"}}, {"id": 42, "type": "LTXVConcatAVLatent", "pos": [941.6666666666665, 2833.484848484849], "size": [420, 150], "flags": {}, "order": 92, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "video_latent", "type": "LATENT", "link": 27}, {"name": "audio_latent", "type": "LATENT", "link": 12}], "outputs": [{"name": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "links": [59]}], "title": "4. 映像の下地＋固定した音声 | LTXVConcatAVLatent", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LTXVConcatAVLatent"}}, {"id": 43, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [82.80886166666652, 1957.8248633333367], "size": [740.6060606060613, 245.15151515151547], "flags": {}, "order": 17, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["## ④ 両モード共通のリップシンク\n\nWAV → 数値化 → **音声側のノイズマスクを0** → 映像と一緒に⑤へ。\n\n生成中に音声を変更せず、その音に合わせて映像を作るための接続です。口の動きは生成後にも確認します。\n\n完成時の声は⑥で元のWAVを直接使います。VAEで再変換した声に置き換えません。\n\n**心の声：** 無音WAVを渡し、「内面の独白・発声せず口を閉じたまま唇を動かさない」と明記。独白は編集で追加。\n\n①の「リップシンク」スイッチで切り替えます。OFFは効果音用の別生成などの例外。別生成した効果音を重ねても、セリフの時刻・速度は変えません。"], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## ④ 両モード共通のリップシンク\n\nWAV → 数値化 → **音声側のノイズマスクを0** → 映像と一緒に⑤へ。\n\n生成中に音声を変更せず、その音に合わせて映像を作るための接続です。口の動きは生成後にも確認します。\n\n完成時の声は⑥で元のWAVを直接使います。VAEで再変換した声に置き換えません。\n\n**心の声：** 無音WAVを渡し、「内面の独白・発声せず口を閉じたまま唇を動かさない」と明記。独白は編集で追加。\n\n音声固定OFFは効果音用の別生成などの例外。別生成した効果音を重ねても、セリフの時刻・速度は変えません。"}, "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 44, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "pos": [1952.7272727272737, 2808.6363636363703], "size": [380, 150], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "on_false", "type": "LATENT", "link": 60, "shape": 7}, {"name": "on_true", "type": "LATENT", "link": 59, "shape": 7}, {"name": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "link": 61, "widget": {"name": "switch"}}], "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "LATENT", "links": [17]}], "title": "ON：音声を固定した下地／OFF：元の下地 | ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "widgets_values": [true]}, {"id": 45, "type": "RandomNoise", "pos": [1527.2727272727282, 2580.757575757581], "size": [350, 110], "flags": {}, "order": 18, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "NOISE", "type": "NOISE", "links": [13]}], "title": "シード：生成の出発点 | RandomNoise", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RandomNoise"}, "widgets_values": [2026100201, "fixed"], "widgets_values_named": {"noise_seed": 2026093001, "control_after_generate": "fixed"}}, {"id": 46, "type": "KSamplerSelect", "pos": [1543.9393939393947, 2798.939393939399], "size": [350, 100], "flags": {}, "order": 19, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "SAMPLER", "type": "SAMPLER", "links": [15]}], "title": "計算方法：er_sde | KSamplerSelect", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "KSamplerSelect"}, "widgets_values": ["er_sde"], "widgets_values_named": {"sampler_name": "er_sde"}}, {"id": 47, "type": "BasicScheduler", "pos": [1546.9696969696977, 2976.2121212121265], "size": [356.198828125, 145], "flags": {}, "order": 73, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "model", "type": "MODEL", "link": 29}, {"name": "steps", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "step