"name": "vae", "type": "VAE", "link": 34}], "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "links": [63]}], "title": "生成した数値を音へ戻す（OFF時用） | VAEDecodeAudio", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}}, {"id": 52, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "pos": [3443.6363636363662, 2822.272727272725], "size": [380, 150], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "on_false", "type": "AUDIO", "link": 63, "shape": 7}, {"name": "on_true", "type": "AUDIO", "link": 62, "shape": 7}, {"name": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "link": 64, "widget": {"name": "switch"}}], "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "AUDIO", "links": [21]}], "title": "ON：元のWAV／OFF：生成音 | ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "widgets_values": [true]}, {"id": 53, "type": "CreateVideo", "pos": [3807.8787878787907, 2353.787878787878], "size": [300, 110], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "link": 20}, {"name": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "link": 21, "shape": 7}], "outputs": [{"name": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "links": [69]}], "title": "映像＋選んだ音声 → 動画にまとめる | CreateVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "Node name for S&R": "CreateVideo"}, "widgets_values": [24]}, {"id": 55, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "pos": [1508.3333333333328, 243.33333333333314], "size": [480, 590], "flags": {}, "order": 20, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "links": [55]}], "title": "Ref用：参照の役割と演技を書く | PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "widgets_values": ["（Ref モードのプロンプト。ノートブックのセル6が書き込みます）"], "widgets_values_named": {"value": "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> defines the character appearance and scene composition.\n<Audio 1> is the single supplied soundtrack containing all speakers, exact pauses and timing.\n\nsummary:\nA finished Japanese 2D anime shot with speech synchronized to the fixed input soundtrack.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Audio 1>: fully_copy - preserve the supplied speech and intentional pauses at their exact times.\n<Picture 1>: fully_preserved - character identity, clothing, environment and spatial relationships.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] Describe the composition, current posture, action and camera. Replace this text with exact speaker intervals and the original Japanese dialogue in <d>...</d>. The designated speaker follows the fixed soundtrack. Listening characters keep their mouths closed. Preserve the previous shot's character state; change the framing at this generation boundary.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe fixed input soundtrack defines dialogue timing, pauses and speaker turns. Additional sound effects are mixed separately without moving or stretching dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.\n"}}, {"id": 56, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "pos": [1508.3333333333328, 1103.3333333333333], "size": [480, 580], "flags": {}, "order": 21, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "links": [38]}], "title": "Frame用：開始からの動きを書く | PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "widgets_values": ["（Frame モードのプロンプト。ノートブックのセル6が書き込みます）"], "widgets_values_named": {"value": "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] A finished Japanese 2D anime shot. Preserve the first frame's composition, posture, clothing and room. Describe the subsequent action and camera. Replace this text with exact speaker intervals and Japanese dialogue in <d>...</d>. Only the designated speaker moves their mouth, following the fixed input soundtrack. Listening characters keep their mouths closed.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe fixed input soundtrack defines dialogue timing and pauses. Sound effects are mixed separately without changing speech timing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.\n"}}, {"id": 57, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [1516.6666666666665, -166.6666666666669], "size": [573.3333333333348, 176.66666666666686], "flags": {}, "order": 22, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["## ② 画像・動画・文章を、生成に使う条件へ変換\n\n**Ref：** 画像最大4枚と動画1本を参照。　**Frame：** 開始画像と任意の終了画像。\n\n各ノードから2本出ます。**positive＝演出条件**、**LATENT＝映像と音の数値上の下地**。\n\nここでは完成動画はまだ作りません。③で選ばれたモードだけを実行します。"], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## ② 画像・動画・文章を、生成に使う条件へ変換\n\n**Ref：** 画像最大4枚と動画1本を参照。　**Frame：** 開始画像と任意の終了画像。\n\n各ノードから2本出ます。**positive＝演出条件**、**LATENT＝映像と音の数値上の下地**。\n\nここでは完成動画はまだ作りません。③で選ばれたモードだけを実行します。"}, "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 58, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [2960.757575757575, 1072.5757575757564], "size": [472.727272727273, 244.848484848485], "flags": {}, "order": 23, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["## ③ 同じスイッチで2本をそろえて選ぶ\n\n①の FrameToVideo が **OFFならRef、ONならFrame**。\n\n条件と下地は必ず同じモードから受け取ります。\n\n演出条件は⑤へ。下地は④で音声を固定してから⑤へ。\n\n**モデルを2回動かす分岐ではありません。** 選ばれた側だけを処理します。"], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## ③ 同じスイッチで2本をそろえて選ぶ\n\n①の FrameToVideo が **OFFならRef、ONならFrame**。\n\n条件と下地は必ず同じモードから受け取ります。\n\n演出条件は⑤へ。下地は④で音声を固定してから⑤へ。\n\n**モデルを2回動かす分岐ではありません。** 選ばれた側だけを処理します。"}, "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 59, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [1508.181818181816, 2036.9696969696993], "size": [602.4242424242434, 136.060606060606], "flags": {}, "order": 24, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["## ⑤ 生成の中心\n\n**演出・モデル・シード・計算方法・ステップ・映像と音の下地**を受け取って生成。\n\n出力はまだ数値データ。⑥で見られる映像・聴ける音へ戻します。"], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## ⑤ 生成の中心\n\n**演出・モデル・シード・計算方法・ステップ・映像と音の下地**を受け取って生成。\n\n出力はまだ数値データ。⑥で見られる映像・聴ける音へ戻します。"}, "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 60, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [2958.333333333334, 2046.6666666666667], "size": [640.0000000000009, 155], "flags": {}, "order": 25, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["## ⑥ 元のセリフを保って保存\n\n音声固定ONでは元のWAVを採用。OFFではH3の生成音を採用。**24fps、速度変更なし**。\n\n効果音は必要に応じて別トラックで追加。MP4音声はAAC圧縮です。"], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## ⑥ 元のセリフを保って保存\n\n音声固定ONでは元のWAVを採用。OFFではH3の生成音を採用。**24fps、速度変更なし**。\n\n効果音は必要に応じて別トラックで追加。MP4音声はAAC圧縮です。"}, "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 61, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [45.947878787878736, 3337.754848484847], "size": [801.2121212121237, 174.69696969696997], "flags": {}, "order": 26, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["## ⑦ 共通の道具を準備する（通常は固定）\n\n上の段は **FastVideo → 配分調整 → バックエンド → VSA → GPU 0**。同じFastVideoモデルで4／8ステップを使います。\n\n下の段は **Qwen＝文章・参照を読む役、映像VAE＝画像と数値の変換、音声VAE＝音と数値の変換**。RunPodは1枚なので、すべてGPU 0。\n\n右端から②・④・⑤・⑥へ直接配線しています。ここにTurbo LoRAや別モデルの分岐はありません。"], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## ⑦ 共通の道具を準備する（通常は固定）\n\n上の段は **FastVideo → 配分調整 → バックエンド → VSA → GPU 0**。同じFastVideoモデルで4／8ステップを使います。\n\n下の段は **Qwen＝文章・参照を読む役、映像VAE＝画像と数値の変換、音声VAE＝音と数値の変換**。これらはGPU 1。\n\n右端のSetと同名のGetが、②・④・⑤・⑥へ道具を渡します。ここにTurbo LoRAや別モデルの分岐はありません。"}, "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 110, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "pos": [2028, 600], "size": [380, 150], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "on_false", "type": "AUDIO", "link": null, "shape": 7}, {"name": "on_true", "type": "AUDIO", "link": 65, "shape": 7}, {"name": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "link": 66, "widget": {"name": "switch"}}], "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "AUDIO", "links": [67]}], "title": "ONのときだけ確定音声を参照に渡す | ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "widgets_values": [true]}, {"id": 111, "type": "GetVideoComponents", "pos": [1114, 1641], "size": [260, 120], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 2, "inputs": [{"name": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "link": 68}], "outputs": [{"n